  "answer_text": "Because *Miraculous: Tales of Ladybug & Cat Noir* released episodes in different orders depending on the country, broadcaster, or streaming service, \"Season 2, Episode 12\" can refer to a few different episodes. \n\nSince Season 2 has already fully aired (originally releasing between 2017 and 2018), the release dates for the episodes that qualify as \"Episode 12\" depending on the viewing order are detailed below:\n\n### 1. **\"Captain Hardrock\"** (US Netflix & English Broadcasting Order)\nIn many English-speaking regions, including on Netflix in the United States, **\"Captain Hardrock\"** is officially listed as Season 2, Episode 12.\n* **US / Netflix Release Date:** March 30, 2018\n* **France (TFOU) Premiere:** May 20, 2018\n\n### 2. **\"Sapotis\"** (By Production Code: 212)\nIf you are looking at the production order (where the code is 212), the 12th episode of the season is **\"Sapotis\"**. This is the episode where Alya receives the Fox Miraculous and becomes Rena Rouge.\n* **France (TFOU) Premiere:** January 21, 2018\n* **US / Netflix Release Date:** March 30, 2018\n\n### 3. **\"Gorizilla\"** (France Broadcasting Order)\nIf you are following the original airing order on France's TFOU network, the 12th episode of the season to be broadcast was **\"Gorizilla\"**. \n* **World Premiere (Canada's Family Channel):** March 14, 2018\n* **US / Netflix Release Date:** March 30, 2018\n* **France (TFOU) Premiere:** May 13, 2018\n\nAll of these episodes are currently available to stream on platforms like Disney+ and Netflix, depending on your region.",
